ROSCA development script 01 completed.

Scope:
- rosca_groups
- rosca_members
- rosca_cycles
- rosca_contributions
- rosca_payouts
- join-code based invite/join flow
- member order = payout order
- weekly/monthly cycle scheduling
- end-of-month safe monthly dates
- forming -> active transition only when all member slots are filled
- materialized planned contribution obligations
- materialized planned payouts
- explicit planned vs paid contribution state
- explicit planned vs paid payout state
- member or owner may record contribution paid
- only owner may record payout paid
- no automatic normal-ledger mutation
- RLS read isolation
- security-definer mutation validation
- group list RPC
- detailed group/member/cycle/contribution/payout RPC
- TypeScript/Zod contracts
- Supabase service layer
- TanStack Query hooks

